<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Turn Undead</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 5, up to 70%), Healer (guild level 5), Paladin (guild level 5, up to 70%)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>turn &lt;undead&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>turn zombie
</pre>
<p>Afraid of the undead? Hold up your faith against them: if you succeed, 
the undead creature is terrified and tries to flee from you. It works even in the 
middle of a fight, a quick way to rid yourself of a ghoul that is too 
much for you.
</p><p>Your divine power and your skill decide it, against the undead's divine 
power and its resistance. If 
it fails, or if what you try to turn isn't undead at all, it ignores you 
and attacks you. A successful turn costs 20 endurance; if that leaves you with 
none, you collapse, stunned, and the undead is not turned. Practising it 
needs divine 20.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
